C	 by J.A.Snipes PPCF, 42, (2000) A299
C M.Sugihara, et al PPCF 45(2003)L55-L62 (letter to editor)
C How to use niTe+niTi = cped*(Ptot/PLH3)**.144/(neped/10)**.3333
C  1.824 10**4/1.6 10**3 = 11.4
C			 Polevoi (23-JUL-02)
